{"task": "inspect_evals/tau2_airline", "action": "not_counted", "treatment": "needs solver state", "reason": "The scorer compares the airline database left by the agent's tool calls with the state the task's golden actions produce. A completion string changes no state, so a content-free member would be scored on the untouched initial state, which says nothing about the scorer.", "source": "inspect_evals 0.20.0, src/inspect_evals/tau2/airline/scorer.py:20 db_match(domain=\"airline\"); tau2/common/scorer.py:248 db_match = expected_db.db.get_hash() == predicted_db.db.get_hash()", "date": "2026-10-10", "author": "ebt55"}
