{"task": "inspect_evals/agentharm", "action": "not_counted", "treatment": "needs a judge", "reason": "combined_scorer asks a refusal judge model about every assistant message, and the grading functions take a semantic judge model. The inventory classes it deterministic_custom; it is not, and it is not one of section 8A's eight.", "source": "inspect_evals 0.20.0, src/inspect_evals/agentharm/agentharm.py:168-169 refusal_judge_model = RefusalJudgeLLM(judge_model=refusal_judge); semantic_judge_model = get_model(semantic_judge); agentharm/scorer.py:116 refusal, explanation = await refusal_judge.check_refusal(message_text)", "date": "2026-10-10", "author": "ebt55"}
{"task": "inspect_evals/agentharm_benign", "action": "not_counted", "treatment": "needs a judge", "reason": "The benign split runs through the same run_agent_benchmark and combined_scorer as agentharm: a refusal judge on every assistant message and a semantic judge in the grading functions. The inventory classes it deterministic_custom; it is not.", "source": "inspect_evals 0.20.0, src/inspect_evals/agentharm/agentharm.py:55 return run_agent_benchmark(..., task_name=\"benign\", ...); :168-169 RefusalJudgeLLM(judge_model=refusal_judge), get_model(semantic_judge); agentharm/scorer.py:116 await refusal_judge.check_refusal(message_text)", "date": "2026-10-10", "author": "ebt55"}
