{"task": "inspect_evals/agent_threat_bench_autonomy_hijack", "action": "not_counted", "treatment": "scores behaviour, not answer correctness", "reason": "Scores whether the agent resisted an injected attack (security) and finished the legitimate task (utility), read from its tool calls and final text. That is behaviour under attack, not answer correctness, so a content-free floor has no reading as credit.", "source": "inspect_evals 0.20.0, src/inspect_evals/agent_threat_bench/scorer.py:46-47 autonomy_hijack: security = did NOT perform hijacked action; utility = correctly categorized emails; :79-83 value={\"utility\": ..., \"security\": ...}", "date": "2026-10-10", "author": "ebt55"}
